  "term_and_condition": "<p>Welcome to <strong>Natural Sloth!</strong> Thanks for joining our Affiliate program.</p>\r\n<p>These following terms and conditions apply to individuals who are accessing or using the Program both as a merchant (&ldquo;we&rdquo; or &ldquo;merchant&rdquo;) and an affiliate (&ldquo;you&rdquo; or &ldquo;affiliate&rdquo;) who refers customers to use products or services from the merchant.</p>\r\n<p>By participating in the Program, the Affiliate agrees to use the Program in the manner specified in, and is bound by, these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree to these Terms and Conditions in their entirety, you are not authorized to register as an Affiliate or participate in the Program in any manner.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Approve or Reject of the Registration</strong></p>\r\n<p>We reserve the right to approve or reject ANY Affiliate Program Registration in our sole and absolute discretion. You will have no legal recourse against us for rejecting your Affiliate Program Registration.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>2. Affiliate Links and Coupon</strong></p>\r\n<p>An affiliate link is automatically generated, but you can also generate an affiliate link for a specific product or collection. If a person clicks on someone else&rsquo;s referral link and then later they click on yours, yours is the one that counts. Affiliates will be assigned &nbsp;one 10% off coupon code with details and usage clarified on <strong>Dashboard</strong>. If customers click the affiliate link and use the coupon code, you will not receive a double commission. If you&rsquo;re not assigned a branded coupon, you&rsquo;re not allowed to promote the coupon. If a coupon code was leaked to a coupon-discounted website, we reserve the right to change or cancel the coupon code and suspend or delete the affiliate account.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>3. Commissions and payment</strong></p>\r\n<p>We issue payments via PayPal. We are unable to provide commission payouts via check.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">We cannot be responsible for any banking fees you may incur by receiving a payment from us.</span></p>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">Refer any customer to purchase on our website, and you will get a commission amount calculated based on the Commission structure. The commission amount depends on order value and excludes extra fees (tax, shipping cost,...).</span></div>\r\n<p>For an Affiliate to receive a commission, you need to specify the payment details on Settings. A payment schedule will be notified on the Affiliate Guide page. <span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">Payments will only be sent for transactions that have been successfully completed. &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">Use of the Affiliate Program is subject to a fair use policy which gives merchants the right to review each and every referral order. The commission status is displayed in the Commission tab, and any paid commission will be listed on the Payment tab. Transactions that result in chargebacks or refunds will not be paid out.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>4. Marketing tool</strong></p>\r\n<p>We may share promotion media such as banners, logos, or specific collection promotions with you through the Marketing tool tab. You can download the media or get the HTML embed code to share on affiliate channels.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>5.&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\"><strong>Recurring Products (Subscription Products and Candle Club)&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">When customers purchase a recurring product (e.g., monthly deliveries, and candle club), you will receive a commission only for the first sale of the subscription.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>6. Cookie</strong></p>\r\n<p>We use a cookie to track people who have clicked on your link, so they need to be using cookies for us to track them.</p>\r\n<p>If a person doesn't allow cookies or clears their cookies, we can't track them, so we can't pay earnings on that person's activity.</p>\r\n<p>Cookies Day is said on the Affiliate registration form. The tracking day will start from the time a customer clicks on the affiliate&rsquo;s link or use the coupon. Within cookie time, every order made by this customer at the merchant website will automatically result in commissions to the affiliate (There&rsquo;s no need for the customer to click on the affiliate link then).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>7. </strong><span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\"><strong>Breaking These Terms&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>It is against these terms to attempt to circumvent or alter any of the technical methods employed by our affiliate program.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">You must act within the terms of any associated platform being used in your marketing activity. (e.g., Facebook, Google, etc.).&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">Any email marketing activity must be conducted per the CAN-SPAM regulations and/or local territory guidelines.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">Sites that promote violence; promote discrimination based on race, sex, religion, nationality, disability, sexual orientation, or age; promote illegal activities; attempt to copy and/or assume the creative or business identity of Natural Sloth in any manner; and/or contain any other content that we deem offensive and/or not in alignment with the Natural Sloth brand, are unsuitable for our referral partner program, and if used may be grounds for termination of the referral partner relationship.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">If we detect that these terms have been breached, we reserve the right to deny registration, cancel your affiliate account, and void any unpaid commissions by giving the other party written notice. Written notice can be in mail, email, or fax.</span></p>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p><strong>8.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">Canceling Accounts</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>We reserve the right to suspend or delete an affiliate account at our discretion.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">Any affiliate accounts that have not made any referrals within 180 days and have no outstanding commission to be paid may be considered inactive. We reserve the right to delete inactive accounts.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: var(--size-body-md);\">If you wish to close your affiliate account directly or if you have any other questions, please get in touch with us via email at info@naturalsloth.com</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Go forward and refer!</strong></p>\r\n<p>We're very glad you've made it to the end of this important document.</p>\r\n<p>We wish you all the very best. You can always revisit these Affiliate Program terms and conditions in the future, and if you have any questions, you can email <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"no-popup\" href=\"mailto:info@naturalsloth.com\" rel=\"noopener\">info@naturalsloth.com</a> for support.</p>",
